The 125CA is an optional setting for the 155CA yagi.
It is centered on 24.940 MHz for CW and Phone
operation.  VSWR is less than 1.5 over the entire
band.  Maximum gain is 7.8 dBd and maximum F/B is 
28 dB.

Beta rod length= 11.625 inches (measured from tubing
center to inside edge of clamp).  Pigtail length= 7 
inches.  Balun= Hy-Gain BN-86  (voltage type).

Radiation patterns and VSWR were verified in October
1990.  9-20-91  RC


